    "Applies to every note in “%@” and its sub-notebooks. Use / for levels, e.g. School/Math. An empty name takes the notes out of the notebook and lifts its sub-notebooks to the top." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the notebook's path",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
